-- ---------- doctor_availabilities ----------
-- Every doctor has at least one weekly holiday, and some have two. A working day
-- spans AT MOST 10 hours including its break; short days are 5 hours with no break.



-- ---------- appointments (10,000, spread over 2020-2026) ----------
-- Every appointment falls on a day the doctor actually works, inside their hours,
-- and never during their break - so availability queries and appointment queries agree.

























